ice equipment. In addition, the company offers enhanced services and programs consisting of used oil, oil filter, and battery recycling; battery, wiper, and bulb replacement; battery diagnostic testing; electrical and module testing; check engine light code extraction; loaner tool program; referrals to trusted local repair shops; drum and rotor resurfacing; custom hydraulic hoses; and professional paint shop mixing and related materials. It offers its products to do-it-yourself and professional service providers for domestic and imported automobiles, vans, and trucks. It offers its products under the BesTest, BrakeBest, Cartek, Import Direct, MasterPro, MicroGard, Murray, Omnispark, O'Reilly Auto Parts, Precision, PowerTorque, SuperStart, Syntec, and Ultima brand names. O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. was founded in 1957 and is headquartered in Springfield, Missouri.","employees":95822,"website":"https://www.oreillyauto.com","country":"United States","city":"Springfield","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Gregory L. Henslee","title":"Executive Chairman"},{"name":"Mr. Brad W. Beckham","title":"Chief Executive Officer"},{"name":"Mr. David E. O'Reilly","title":"Executive Vice Chairman"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":16.43,"tpe":19.93,"ps":2.008,"pfcf":27.35,"peg":1.45,"pb":6.316,"rev_growth":0.057,"eps_growth":0.108,"eps_growth_fwd":0.0761,"eps_growth_next":0.105,"div_yield":0.012,"roe":0.309,"roa":0.08208,"de":110.9,"gross_margin":0.431,"op_margin":0.1359,"profit_margin":0.0934,"current_ratio":1.111},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":24.59,"sector":16.43,"score":-1,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":28.55,"sector":19.93,"score":-1,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.917,"sector":2.008,"score":-1,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":46.31,"sector":27.35,"score":-1,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":2.2,"sector":1.45,"score":null,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Bo